{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226430","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1222643001:1":{"text":"诸、诸位，找我有什么事啊？我可是个本本分分的好商人……","source_cn":"诸、诸位，找我有什么事啊？我可是个本本分分的好商人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE9A67DC522AA48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222643002:1":{"text":"你要是好商人，那卢卡就是耀光圣堂的圣骑士了。","source_cn":"你要是好商人，那卢卡就是耀光圣堂的圣骑士了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A27ED5F32778AD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222643003:0":{"text":"先生，我们是受索尼娅委托，专程来找你的。","source_cn":"先生，我们是受索尼娅委托，专程来找你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560AAA97E85FF243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222643004:1":{"text":"血薇帮的当家找我做什么……往常来找我的都是卢卡。","source_cn":"血薇帮的当家找我做什么……往常来找我的都是卢卡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C998AD49683D47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222643005:1":{"text":"卢卡有他的任务。索尼娅很看重你的情报网，最近有什么风吹草动吗？","source_cn":"卢卡有他的任务。索尼娅很看重你的情报网，最近有什么风吹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48A1F4B06855E24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222643006:1":{"text":"呵呵，锈锚港每天发生的事情可太多了，比如老莫里家的鸡刚死，这种你们也要听吗？","source_cn":"呵呵，锈锚港每天发生的事情可太多了，比如老莫里家的鸡刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C69E5D87535179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222643007:1":{"text":"不要耍嘴皮子，你知道我们想听更重要的情报。","source_cn":"不要耍嘴皮子，你知道我们想听更重要的情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D5E94E6E8AF64D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222643008:1":{"text":"举个例子？","source_cn":"举个例子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FED6567165CDF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1222643008":{"text":"举个例子？","source_cn":"举个例子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FED6567165CDF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222643009:1":{"text":"血薇帮解除了海禁，谁会在这时做偷渡生意啊？没必要挣那个危险钱。","source_cn":"血薇帮解除了海禁，谁会在这时做偷渡生意啊？没必要挣那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x074C554227269CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222643011:1":{"text":"听上去没什么大问题。","source_cn":"听上去没什么大问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3E6F5802C81756D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222643012:1":{"text":"有个亡灵杀手潜藏在锈锚港，她很可能在暗地寻找船只，偷渡离港。","source_cn":"有个亡灵杀手潜藏在锈锚港，她很可能在暗地寻找船只，偷渡离港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B2A0DD623398CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222643013:1":{"text":"我知道了，我也是靠着锈锚港吃饭的人，不会眼睁睁看着亡灵祸害发财之地。","source_cn":"我知道了，我也是靠着锈锚港吃饭的人，不会眼睁睁看着亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28337CD81B770609","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222643014:1":{"text":"我会放话出去，让工头和船长们互相监督，看谁敢帮助亡灵偷渡！","source_cn":"我会放话出去，让工头和船长们互相监督，看谁敢帮助亡灵偷渡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2403FE092FCABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222643015:1":{"text":"很好，如果你有相关的线索，记得随时告诉血薇帮，报酬优厚。","source_cn":"很好，如果你有相关的线索，记得随时告诉血薇帮，报酬优厚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F3C556982967A11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222643016:1":{"text":"啊哈哈，没问题，谁会不喜欢亮闪闪的钱币呢？包在我身上！","source_cn":"啊哈哈，没问题，谁会不喜欢亮闪闪的钱币呢？包在我身上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B6E5A54C4FB3583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male